    "comment": "### 🚀 Advanced Series Extractor\n\nConverts CSV data to styled JSON series. Supports dynamic calc, logic, and auto-labeling.\n\n#### 💡 Core Syntax:\n1. **Template**: `{}` for vars. E.g., `Label: {col} (Area={area:.1f})`\n2. **Python Expr**: Start with `=`. E.g., `Color: = 'red' if area > 100 else 'blue'`\n\n#### 🧪 Variables:\n- `col`: Y column name.\n- `match`: Wildcard capture.\n- `index`: Series index.\n- `area`: Integration area (abs).\n- `max_y`, `min_y`, `mean_y`: Y stats.\n- `len`: Data count.\n- `file`, `stem`: Filenames.\n- `x`, `y`: Coordinates (for mark_text).\n\n#### 🛠️ Usage:\n- **Dynamic Fill**: `fill_alpha` `= 0.8 if 'Sat' in match else 0.6`.\n- **Hide**: `fill_alpha` `0` to disable fill.\n- **Auto ID**: `series_id_template` `{col}` for referencing."
